Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='secretarymemory', at=datetime(2026, 10, 2, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="The secretary's memory is a prodrome of its own with erasable words, kept in a box-local text store", body="The secretary's memory is a prodrome of its own with erasable text (2026-10-02, ARCHITECTURE §10.3; `secretary::memories`): its HISTORY, `memory/`, says which facts were remembered and forgotten, by id, a two-phase set whose register only climbs, and names each fact's words by a salted hash; the WORDS are `secretary-memory-texts/`, one file per fact, box-local, in the vault, never pushed, and deleted by forgetting, so the history stays verifiable while the words are gone. Every session opening is told the facts and the digest's view in the owner's words alone, the rest by kind (`secretary::told`), and `zoom` opens a part as tainted as what it holds.", rationale="Decided 2026-10-02 (ARCHITECTURE §10.3). This is the data tree's memory/, not the code repository's.", supersedes=()))